    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5206" root="جدح" body-key="j">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُجَدَّحٌ</span></b>  Beverage, or wine, (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَرَاب</span>,) <i>stirred
about:</i> (S, K:) and in like manner, blood, when
it is stirred about in the body of a gored animal
by the goring horn. (L.)

